    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Additional Spells.</strong> Your mastery keeps certain spells always at the ready. Once you have spell slots of a level shown in the Evocation Adept Spells table, you always have the spells of that level and lower prepared.</p><p><strong>Fueled Evocation.</strong> Once per turn, when you cast an Evocation spell and deal damage, you can roll up to two of your unexpended Hit Point Dice and add the total to one of the spell's damage rolls. Those Hit Point Dice are then expended.</p><h4>Evocation Adept Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Slot Level</th><th>Spell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplChromaticO]{Chromatic Orb}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShatter000]{Shatter}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireball00]{Fireball}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplVitriolicS]{Vitriolic Sphere}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofForc]{Wall of Force}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-1THEwrvw9sld7VQF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the spells of the levels whose slots you have; add the others when you gain those slots. <em>Fueled Evocation</em> spends and rolls two of your largest Hit Point Dice; to use only one, change the consumption in the dialog.</p></section>",
